 "description": "Feature set containing the location and features of all Rest Areas, Welcome Centers, Travel Plazas on the interstates in West Virginia. Data obtained through the West Virginia Department of Transportation All Stays\u2014trucker resources(https://www.allstays.com/c/truck-stops-west-virginia.htm), Truckers Directory\u2014truck stops in WV Guide (http://www.truckstopsandservices.com/listcatbusinesses.php?id=19&amp;state=50), and Truck Stops online(http://www.truckstopsonline.com/Search_State.aspx?state=WV), Attributes shared in this feature class include: RouteID, Interstate Number, Feature Name, City, County, Number of Parking Spaces for Cars and Trucks, Restrooms, ADA Compliant Restrooms, Family Restrooms, Tourist Information, Food, Type of Food Establishment, (vending machines, snack bar, fast food, restaurant, convenience store), Fuel, Gift Shop, Picnic Tables, DOH District, Lat, and Long, feature type and exact mile point.. Data has been verified using aerial imagery, google earth ,and WVDOT Measurement App ( https://gis.transportation.wv.gov/measures/). Data is current as of November 1, 2018. Data Coordinate System: NAD_1983_UTM_Zone_17N",
